  description: '2 Level 7 Dragon monsters

    If this card is Xyz Summoned: You
    can target 1 Level 4 or lower "Dragon Ruler" monster in your GY or banishment;
    Special Summon 1 Level/Rank 7 "Dragon Ruler" monster that is mentioned on that
    targeted monster from your Deck or banishment, then shuffle the targeted monster
    into the Deck. When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card or effect (Quick
    Effect): You can detach 2 materials from this card; negate the activation, and
    if you do, banish that card. You can only use each effect of "Eclipse, Dragon
    Ruler of Catastrophes" once per turn.'
